# Appointly Sprint 1 - API evidence (2026-11-14T23:17:07Z, base http://localhost:4100/api/v1)

### STS-S1-001  ADMIN signs in: 200 + HttpOnly / SameSite=Strict cookies
$ curl -X POST /auth/login -d '{"email":"admin@appointly.local","password":"<seed demo password>"}'
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Set-Cookie: access_token=<redacted>; Max-Age=900; Path=/; Expires=Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:32:07 GMT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict
Set-Cookie: refresh_token=<redacted>; Max-Age=604800; Path=/; Expires=Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:17:07 GMT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":true,"data":{"userId":"aa52ef46-9190-4795-9638-37ebb531bdb5","email":"admin@appointly.local","role":"ADMIN"},"message":"Login successful."}

### STS-S1-001  GET /auth/me returns the role of the signed-in user
$ curl -X GET /auth/me
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":true,"data":{"userId":"aa52ef46-9190-4795-9638-37ebb531bdb5","email":"admin@appointly.local","role":"ADMIN","accountStatus":"ACTIVE","profileId":"aa52ef46-9190-4795-9638-37ebb531bdb5","fullName":"Clinic Administrator"},"message":"Current user retrieved successfully."}

### STS-S1-001  POST /auth/logout revokes the session
$ curl -X POST /auth/logout
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Set-Cookie: access_token=; Path=/; Expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict
Set-Cookie: refresh_token=; Path=/; Expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":true,"data":null,"message":"Logged out successfully."}

### STS-S1-001  GET /auth/me after logout: 401
$ curl -X GET /auth/me
HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"UNAUTHORIZED","message":"Authentication token is required."}}

### STS-S1-001  INACTIVE account: 403 ACCOUNT_INACTIVE
$ curl -X POST /auth/login -d '{"email":"inactive@appointly.local","password":"<seed demo password>"}'
HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"ACCOUNT_INACTIVE","message":"Account is inactive. Please contact your clinic administrator."}}

