### STS-S1-008  Overlapping shifts 11:00-14:00 vs 09:00-12:00: 422 INVALID_SCHEDULE_WINDOW
$ curl -X PUT /doctors/me/schedule -d '{"shifts":[{"dayOfWeek":6,"startTime":"09:00","endTime":"12:00","isActive":true},{"dayOfWeek":6,"startTime":"11:00","endTime":"14:00","isActive":true}]}'
HTTP/1.1 422 Unprocessable Entity
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"INVALID_SCHEDULE_WINDOW","message":"Schedule windows on the same day (6) must not overlap: [09:00–12:00] and [11:00–14:00]."}}

