### STS-S1-006  Service duration 0 is rejected: 400
$ curl -X POST /admin/services -d '{"serviceName":"Boundary Zero","durationMinutes":0}'
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"VALIDATION_ERROR","message":"durationMinutes: Duration must be between 1 and 480 minutes"}}

### STS-S1-006  Service duration 481 is rejected: 400
$ curl -X POST /admin/services -d '{"serviceName":"Boundary Over","durationMinutes":481}'
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"VALIDATION_ERROR","message":"durationMinutes: Duration must be between 1 and 480 minutes"}}

### STS-S1-009  Cancellation cutoff -1 is rejected: 400
$ curl -X PATCH /admin/settings -d '{"cancellationCutoffHours":-1}'
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"success":false,"error":{"code":"VALIDATION_ERROR","message":"cancellationCutoffHours: cancellationCutoffHours must be an integer greater than or equal to 0"}}

